### 변수 설정
@hostname = localhost
@port = 8080
@baseUrl = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}/api/rule
@roomId = 1
@flowId = 2
@scheduleId = 1

### [플로우 스케줄 생성] 요일별 정상 운영 시간대 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/flows/{{flowId}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "startTime": "09:00:00",
  "endTime": "18:00:00"
}

### [특정 플로우의 스케줄 목록 조회]
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/flows/{{flowId}}/schedules
Accept: application/json

### [특정 플로우의 특정 스케줄 단건 조회]
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/flows/{{flowId}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Accept: application/json

### [플로우 스케줄 삭제]
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/flows/{{flowId}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
